1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,002
WenQuest Cam and WenQuest Bearing are two industry design tools ready to deliver.

2
00:00:05,022 --> 00:00:07,459
They run in the browser, nothing to install.

3
00:00:08,479 --> 00:00:12,067
Designing a cam starts with the motion, segment by segment.

4
00:00:12,537 --> 00:00:16,093
Displacement, velocity and acceleration are drawn at once,

5
00:00:16,563 --> 00:00:20,305
and pressure angle, curvature and jerk are checked item by item.

6
00:00:20,325 --> 00:00:22,714
Or let the AI draft it from one sentence.

7
00:00:23,734 --> 00:00:27,074
A whole cam mechanism is worked out together: timing,

8
00:00:27,094 --> 00:00:30,877
camshaft and motor torque, residual vibration in the dwells,

9
00:00:31,347 --> 00:00:34,214
and an automatic search for the highest speed within the limits.

10
00:00:35,234 --> 00:00:37,619
Turn the 3D model right on the page,

11
00:00:38,089 --> 00:00:42,408
then download the 4-axis program, the STEP files and a FreeCAD workbench.

12
00:00:43,428 --> 00:00:43,618
FEA,

13
00:00:43,638 --> 00:00:47,554
fatigue life and whole-machine multibody dynamics run on the same engine as

14
00:00:47,574 --> 00:00:48,603
the digital factory.

15
00:00:49,623 --> 00:00:53,893
WenQuest Bearing covers deep groove, angular contact, tapered, cylindrical,

16
00:00:53,913 --> 00:00:56,410
harmonic flexible and thin-section bearings,

17
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:59,104
with the clearance chain, ball loads,

18
00:00:59,124 --> 00:01:01,772
contact stress and life checked on one page.

19
00:01:02,792 --> 00:01:04,386
It reaches into production too:

20
00:01:04,406 --> 00:01:07,824
paste the ring measurements and it matches the sets automatically.

21
00:01:08,844 --> 00:01:11,987
Inspection data comes in, and roundness, waviness,

22
00:01:12,007 --> 00:01:15,340
control charts and process capability follow at once.

23
00:01:16,360 --> 00:01:20,460
Inner ring, outer ring and rolling elements each get a drawing and a 3D model,

24
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:21,992
ready to continue in FreeCAD.

25
00:01:23,012 --> 00:01:26,611
Both open straight from the WenQuest homepage. No sign-in for the demo,

26
00:01:26,631 --> 00:01:28,140
and reports come in one click.
